<title>FRANCE: Iran seeks 100,000 tonnes feed-barley - traders.</title>
<headline>Iran seeks 100,000 tonnes feed-barley - traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran will tender on May 19 to import 100,000 tonnes of optional-origin feed barley for shipment in August, European grain traders said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
